    <!--
        ModernLight / ModernDark are the Phase 2A default themes.

        Palette (dark, as specified):
            background   #101318   surface          #1B222C
            elevated     #26313D   accent/primary   #5EE0C0
            text         #F0F3F6   text secondary   #A8B3BF
            outline      #34404D
        Designed matching light palette (WCAG AA against the light surfaces):
            background   #F5F7FA   surface          #FFFFFF
            elevated     #FFFFFF   accent/primary   #0F7A68  (5.2:1 on #FFFFFF)
            container    #EDF1F5   on-primary       #FFFFFF
            text         #101318   text secondary   #52606E  (6.3:1 on #FFFFFF)
            outline      #C4CDD6
        Both themes only declare tokens; the legacy attributes are mapped onto
        the tokens so existing screens/drawables follow automatically.
        Misc/test_ui_contracts.py asserts these tokens and the contrast ratios.
    -->

    <style name="ModernLight" parent="DefaultLight">
        <!-- chrome: light app bar / bottom navigation with dark foreground -->
